<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title-main top-title">经历详情</view><view class="figma-menu"><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/></view></view>
<view class="row"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:92rpx;height:92rpx">{{post.initial}}</view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:24rpx"><view class="h3">{{post.author}}</view><view class="tiny">8月13日 · 浙江丽水</view></view><view class="chip">＋关注</view></view><view class="chip-row" style="margin:28rpx 0"><view class="chip">徒步</view><view class="chip">{{post.type}}</view><view class="chip">{{post.stage}}</view></view>
<view class="h2">{{post.title}}</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:20rpx;line-height:2">穿过草木茂密路段后发现小腿有两处红点，<text class="block-break"></text>当时只有轻微瘙痒，没有全身不适。我先用清水清洁并冷敷，按两小时提醒复查时没有继续扩大。</view>
<view class="post-map"><image class="post-map-art" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgFrame1.svg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="author-route">作者已分享完整路线</view><view class="route-label">{{post.route}}</view></view><button class="primary-btn" style="margin-top:38rpx" bindtap="danger">类似情况？先进行安全判断，不照搬他人处理</button><view class="post-meta"><text>♡ {{post.likes}}</text><text>评论 {{post.comments}}</text><text>收藏 {{post.favorites}}</text><text>分享</text></view>
<view class="section-title">评论</view><view class="card card-pad row"><image class="figma-icon lg" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse2.svg"/><view style="margin-left:22rpx"><view class="tiny">林间观察员</view><view>我也在近水路段遇到过，复查提醒很有用。</view><view class="tiny">刚刚 · 回复</view></view></view><view class="comment-bar"><input class="grow" value="{{comment}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="友善地分享经验…"/><view class="send" bindtap="send"><image class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse3.svg"/></view></view><view class="tiny" style="text-align:right;margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="report">举报</view></view>
